,{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目で責任感も強く、看護師としても優秀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"こうやって書くと性格最悪な要素はないのだが、彼女の場合は働く環境が悪かった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理不尽な上司や未熟な後輩の板挟みとなり、いつもしわ寄せを食らうハメに……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結果、表情は常に険しくなり視線も冷たいモノへと変化した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"情熱や思いやりも消え去り、ただ義務感のみを支えに日々の業務を淡々とドライに処置していくだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"患者や同僚にも厳しく接するようになっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「搾精なんて感情殺して作業でやってるに決まってるでしょう」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94559"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d34b135741aaeb808d0741acb733dc9892413b94a75f6dc6594719fc18cf422.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a9db6411d66e0c24eb68ec6234e9f04eeb15ee904656b2eef6b556d885b8842.webp","width":79,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:330119:94559:4956:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c95380","characterName":"クロカワ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94560","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"330119"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23218"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95380"},"originalCharacterName":"クロカワ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the younger nurses. She is an annoying, self-deprecating, and clingy type of person who holds a grudge."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She says she doesn't care about herself anyway, but if she has to take a break, she will harass Yamada in the name of revenge. She sees Yamada as her own kind and is obsessed with him in every way possible."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95380"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"卑屈で自虐的で、何か失敗しても謝罪の前に言い訳が口に出るタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのくせ心の中や、当人のいないところでは相手の悪口を言いまくっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方的な妬み嫉みから憎しみを募らせ、タチの悪い復讐をしでかす陰湿さを持つ、自他共に認めるクズである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強い者には逆らわないが、弱い相手には容赦なくいびってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都合が悪くなると、自分こそが被害者だと涙ながらに騒ぎ立てる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして本心からそうだと信じ切っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヤマダに自分に似たクズ臭を嗅ぎ取り、クズ友になろうとする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23218","sourceWorkId":"30551","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"卑屈で自虐的で、何か失敗しても謝罪の前に言い訳が口に出るタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのくせ心の中では、当人のいないところでは相手の悪口を言いまくっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方的な妬み嫉みから憎しみを募らせ、タチの悪い復讐をしでかす陰湿さを持つ、自他共に認めるクズである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強い者には逆らわないが、弱い相手には容赦無くいびってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都合が悪くなると、自分こそが被害者だと涙ながらに騒ぎ立てる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして本心からそうだと信じ切っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヤマダに自分に似たクズ臭を嗅ぎ取り、クズ共になろうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私がクズならキミは何？ カス？ゴミ？ウジ虫？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94560"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e02fd12c08426342863c0b18c837252606916609db6314bf8be04c370700f3a9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f873bba07b2953634c0a637fbdb80f33252191365b4d54731fa06c7c2c9da6f.webp","width":54,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:330119:94560:4832:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c95381","characterName":"ヤマグチ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94561","match":"